msgid "Documentation for the latest version of Qiskit propagated noise absorption"
msgstr "Dokumentasi untuk versi terkini penyerapan hingar terambat Qiskit"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Propagated noise absorption (PNA)"
msgstr "Penyerapan hingar terambat (PNA)"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title #
#, no-wrap
msgid "Propagated noise absorption (PNA) {#propagated-noise-absorption-pna}"
msgstr "Penyerapan hingar terambat (PNA) {#propagated-noise-absorption-pna}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This package implements propagated noise absorption (PNA) [\\[1\\]](#references) for mitigating errors in the expectation value of observables.\n"
msgstr "Pakej ini melaksanakan penyerapan hingar terambat (PNA) [\\[1\\]](#references) untuk mengurangkan ralat dalam nilai jangkaan observable.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "PNA works by “absorbing” the inverses of the learned noise channels into a target observable using Pauli propagation. That is, each Pauli noise generator in the noise model is classically propagated to the end of the circuit and applied to the observable. This results in a new observable that, when measured on a QPU, mitigates the learned gate noise.\n"
msgstr "PNA berfungsi dengan “menyerap” songsangan saluran hingar yang dipelajari ke dalam observable sasaran menggunakan perambatan Pauli. Iaitu, setiap penjana hingar Pauli dalam model hingar dirambatkan secara klasik hingga akhir litar dan dikenakan pada observable. Ini menghasilkan observable baharu yang, apabila diukur pada QPU, mengurangkan hingar gate yang dipelajari.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "This package is suitable for estimating expectation values of general quantum circuits and Pauli observables; however, the technique is generally most effective on circuits that are near-Clifford.\n"
msgstr "Pakej ini sesuai untuk menganggar nilai jangkaan litar kuantum umum dan observable Pauli; walau bagaimanapun, teknik ini amnya paling berkesan pada litar yang hampir-Clifford.\n"

